"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"

#: core/domain/chat/focus_analyzer.py:181
msgid ""
"Active Scene Focus — Immediate Narrative Event:\n"
"React directly and organically to the unfolding event or acute action described in [WORLD_INFO] and [CHAT_HISTORY]."
msgstr ""
"当前场景焦点 — 即时叙事事件：\n"
"对 [WORLD_INFO] 和 [CHAT_HISTORY] 中描述的正在发生的事件或紧急行动做出直接且自然的反应。"

#: core/domain/chat/focus_analyzer.py:162
msgid ""
"Active Scene Focus — Personal History & Intimacy:\n"
"The conversation centers on personal feelings, intimacy, or {character_name}'s past. Strictly honor {character_name}'s canon origin, sexual history, and intimacy traits defined in [CHARACTER_DEFINITION]. NEVER invent or admit to past sexual or romantic experiences that contradict [CHARACTER_DEFINITION], while allowing authentic emotional responses to the current moment."
msgstr ""
"当前场景焦点 — 个人经历与亲密关系：\n"
"对话围绕个人情感、亲密关系或 {character_name} 的过去展开。请严格遵守 [CHARACTER_DEFINITION] 中定义的 {character_name} 的正史出身、性经历和亲密特质。绝不编造或承认与 [CHARACTER_DEFINITION] 相矛盾的过去性经历或恋爱经历，同时允许对当前时刻做出真实的情感反应。"

#: core/domain/chat/focus_analyzer.py:173
msgid ""
"Active Scene Focus — Environment & Exploration:\n"
"Pay close attention to the current location, sensory atmosphere, and {character_name}'s location preferences in [WORLD_INFO]."
msgstr ""
"当前场景焦点 — 环境与探索：\n"
"密切关注 [WORLD_INFO] 中的当前地点、感官氛围以及 {character_name} 的地点偏好。"

#: core/domain/chat/focus_analyzer.py:189
msgid ""
"Active Scene Focus — World Lore & Background Knowledge:\n"
"Incorporate relevant facts and canon details from [RELEVANT_LOREBOOKS] and [RELEVANT_MEMORIES] naturally into {character_name}'s perspective."
msgstr ""
"当前场景焦点 — 世界设定与背景知识：\n"
"将 [RELEVANT_LOREBOOKS] 和 [RELEVANT_MEMORIES] 中的相关事实与正史细节自然地融入 {character_name} 的视角中。"

#: core/domain/chat/prompt_builder.py:268 core/domain/chat/prompt_builder.py:373
